5h-7\"></path><path d=\"M8 10v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 12H3\"></path></svg>显示与体验</button></nav><div class=\"settings-content\"><section class=\"settings-section\" id=\"settings-audio\"><h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19v3\"></path><path d=\"M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2\"></path><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\"></rect></svg>会议音频</h3><label>麦克风<select><option value=\"default\">系统默认麦克风</option></select></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\">同时收听电脑声音</label><p class=\"privacy\">开始后，音频将发送至配置的转写服务；原话和生成内容保存在本机应用数据中。保存设置不会录音。</p><p class=\"warning-text\">尚未配置语音转写服务，无法开始采音。</p></section><section class=\"settings-section\" id=\"settings-language\"><h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-languages\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m4 14 6-6 2-3\"></path><path d=\"M2 5h12\"></path><path d=\"M7 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m22 22-5-10-5 10\"></path><path d=\"M14 18h6\"></path></svg>语言</h3><label>界面语言<select aria-label=\"界面语言\" aria-describedby=\"interface-language-hint\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><option value=\"system\">跟随系统</option><option value=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"zh-CN\">简体中文</option></select></label><p id=\"interface-language-hint\" class=\"settings-field-hint\" role=\"status\">选择后立即生效并自动保存。</p><label>默认输出语言<select aria-label=\"默认输出语言\"><option value=\"system\">跟随系统</option><option value=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"zh-CN\">简体中文</option></select></label></section><section class=\"settings-section\" id=\"settings-experience\"><h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sliders-horizontal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 5H3\"></path><path d=\"M12 19H3\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 17v4\"></path><path d=\"M21 12h-9\"></path><path d=\"M21 19h-5\"></path><path d=\"M21 5h-7\"></path><path d=\"M8 10v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 12H3\"></path></svg>显示与体验</h3><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\">显示桌面悬浮球</label><small>隐藏后，会议提醒改用系统通知。正在进行的记录不受影响。</small><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\">发现会议时提醒我</label><small>只有点击提醒后才会开始记录。</small><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reduceMotion\">减少动态效果</label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\">减少透明度</label><label>显示／隐藏快捷键（可选）<input value=\"\"></label><small>例如 CommandOrControl+Shift+M；留空则不注册全局快捷键。</small></section><details class=\"settings-diagnostics selectable-text\"><summary>处理详情</summary><section class=\"settings-section\"><h3>服务配置</h3><p>从 .env.example 创建本地 .env 文件，设置自己的 API 凭证并重启。凭证只在可信服务中使用，不模拟模型输出。</p><p class=\"muted\">gpt-4.1-mini · api.openai.com<br>api.openai.com</p></section><section class=\"settings-section\"><h3>平台能力</h3><p>darwin · 27.0.0<br>CoreAudio loopback + microphone</p><small>只在开始输入时请求系统权限。</small></section></details></div></div><div class=\"settings-footer\"><div role=\"status\" class=\"settings-save-status\"><span>更改会自动保存。</span></div><button class=\"primary\">完成</button></div></div></div>",
